---

<section class="professor-card">
  <div class="photo-box">
    YHB
  </div>

  <div>
    <h2 class="professor-name">
      Yoon Hyeok Bae
    </h2>

    <div class="professor-role">
      Associate Professor<br />
      Department of Mechanical & System Design Engineering<br />
      Hongik University
    </div>

    <p class="description">
      Yoon Hyeok Bae is an Associate Professor at Hongik University.
      His research interests include offshore floating systems,
      floater–mooring coupled dynamics, marine hydrodynamics,
      floating offshore wind turbines, digital twins,
      and offshore control systems.
    </p>

    <div class="info-grid">
      <div class="info-card">
        <h3>Education</h3>

        <ul>
          <li>Ph.D. Ocean Engineering, Texas A&M University</li>
          <li>M.S. Ocean Engineering, Texas A&M University</li>
          <li>B.S. Naval Architecture & Ocean Engineering, Seoul National University</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div class="info-card">
        <h3>Experience</h3>

        <ul>
          <li>Associate Professor, Hongik University</li>
          <li>Faculty, Jeju National University</li>
          <li>Collaborative Researcher, NREL</li>
          <li>Postdoctoral Research Associate, Texas A&M</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div class="info-card">
        <h3>Research Areas</h3>

        <ul>
          <li>Offshore Floating Systems</li>
          <li>Floater–Mooring Coupled Dynamics</li>
          <li>Marine Hydrodynamics</li>
          <li>Floating Offshore Wind</li>
          <li>Digital Twin & Control</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .professor-card {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 320px 1fr;
    gap: 64px;

    background: rgba(255,255,255,0.78);
    border: 1px solid rgba(15,23,42,0.08);

    border-radius: 32px;
    padding: 48px;

    backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
  }

  .photo-box {
    width: 100%;
    aspect-ratio: 0.78;

    border-radius: 28px;

    background:
      linear-gradient(135deg,
        rgba(14,165,233,0.12),
        rgba(255,255,255,0.7));

    border: 1px solid rgba(15,23,42,0.06);

    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;

    font-size: 48px;
    font-weight: 800;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    color: #0369a1;
  }

  .professor-name {
    font-size: 42px;
    margin: 0 0 14px;
    letter-spacing: -0.04em;
  }

  .professor-role {
    color: #0f766e;
    font-weight: 600;
    margin-bottom: 28px;
  }

  .description {
    color: #475569;
    margin-bottom: 42px;
    max-width: 760px;
  }

  .info-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: 32px;
  }

  .info-card h3 {
    margin-top: 0;
    margin-bottom: 14px;
    font-size: 18px;
  }

  .info-card ul {
    margin: 0;
    padding-left: 18px;
    color: #475569;
  }

  .info-card li {
    margin-bottom: 10px;
  }

  @media (max-width: 980px) {
    .professor-card {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }

    .info-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }

    .photo-box {
      max-width: 320px;
    }
  }
</style>